                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 104,
                            "last_played": 1628371036
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This looks like it would really be my kind of game. But it has one of the most obtuse and confusing UI's I've ever seen. There are windows on windows which you can't move out of the way or even close without closing all the windows at once. It's very difficult to try to figure out what you're doing. Sometimes you can right click something and you'll get a menu of actions - right click the same thing two seconds later and you don't. There's no feedback on anything, did you actually click on something or not? And on and on.\n\nIn the end it's just too frustrating to try to play this game.\n\nI've also got to tell you, any developer who actually tells a customer they should \"Git gud and don't miss click. \" instead of addressing an issue doesn't deserve your support. They also have a history of abandoning games, and with the 1.0 release of this imminent (years before it should be, this game needs that much additional work), you should expect that this game will soon be \"released\" and then abandoned as well.",
